    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald McDermott are delighted to present this charming well maintained family bungalow, located along Athy Canal in the serene Cardington area at the edge of Athy Town. Offering approximately 87 sq. meters of superbly presented living space. Property offers the opportunity to acquire a beautiful home with all the benefits of country living with beautiful walkways on your doorstep and yet all the conveniences of town amenities within close proximity. Property offers spacious accommodation which includes a Porch, Sitting Room, Kitchen / Dining Area, 2 Bedrooms and Bathroom. It benefits from private services and is equipped with Gas Fired Central Heating for your comfort. Set on a spacious plot (C. 0.22 acre), the property provides ample parking, landscaped gardens for gardening enthusiasts. This impressive residence is a must-see and comes highly recommended. Viewing is strictly by appointment with sole selling agent Adrian Harley of Sherry FitzGerald McDermott.To see current offers or place an offer on this property, register for your mySherryFitz account at SherryFitz.ie"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nPorch - 1.66 x 1.91\nTiled floor. Light fitting.\n\nHallway / Entrance - 5.66 x 1.26\nTiled floor. Light fitting. Radiator. Access to attic.\n\nKitchen / Dining Area - 5.40 x 3.55\nTiled floor. Curtains. Blinds. Solid fitted kitchen units. Tiled splash back. Recessed lights. Vent. Double oven. Gas ohb. Fridge / freezer. Dishwasher.\n\nSitting Room - 4.13 x 4.54\nSolid timber floor. Feature fireplace with marble surround. Recessed lights. Blinds. Curtains. Radiator.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.18 x 4.66\nSolid timber floor. Fitted wardrobe. Light fittings x 2. Blinds. Curtains. Radiator.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.20 x 3.56\nSolid timber floor. Light fitting. Blinds. Curtains. Radiator.\n\nBathroom - 2.64 x 3.12\nTiled floor. Fully tiled walls. W.C. W.H.B & unit. Corner bath. Electric Triton shower unit above bath. Radiator. Blinds. Light fitting. Electric ceiling fan. Wall heater.\n\nRear Hallway - 0.99 x 1.84\nSolid timber floor. Door to rear garden. Light fitting.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Tarmacadam Driveway.</li><li>Panoramic views.</li><li>Garage 4.31 x 2.91.</li><li>Outside tap & lights. Mature garden.</li><li>Paved patio area.</ul>"
      },
